    {
      "content": [
        {
          "anchor": "overview",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Overview",
          "type": "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "Use a ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.SwiftUI/documentation/SwiftUI/UIViewControllerRepresentable",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " instance to create and manage a",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIViewController",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " object in your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "SwiftUI interface. Adopt this protocol in one of your app’s custom",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "instances, and use its methods to create, update, and tear down your view",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "controller. The creation and update processes parallel the behavior of",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "SwiftUI views, and you use them to configure your view controller with your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "app’s current state information. Use the teardown process to remove your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "view controller cleanly from your SwiftUI. For example, you might use the",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "teardown process to notify other objects that the view controller is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "disappearing.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "To add your view controller into your SwiftUI interface, create your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.SwiftUI/documentation/SwiftUI/UIViewControllerRepresentable",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " instance and add it to your SwiftUI",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "interface. The system calls the methods of your custom instance at",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "appropriate times.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent": [
            {
              "text": "The system doesn’t automatically communicate changes occurring within your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "view controller to other parts of your SwiftUI interface. When you want your",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "view controller to coordinate with other SwiftUI views, you must provide a",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier": "doc://com.apple.SwiftUI/documentation/SwiftUI/NSViewControllerRepresentable/Coordinator",
              "isActive": true,
              "type": "reference"
            },
            {
              "text": " instance to facilitate those",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "interactions. For example, you use a coordinator to forward target-action",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and delegate messages from your view controller to any SwiftUI views.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "inlineContent": [
                {
                  "text": "SwiftUI fully controls the layout of the UIKit view controller’s",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "view using the view’s",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIView/center",
                  "isActive": true,
                  "type": "reference"
                },
                {
                  "text": ",",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIView/bounds",
                  "isActive": true,
                  "type": "reference"
                },
                {
                  "text": ",",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIView/frame",
                  "isActive": true,
                  "type": "reference"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", and",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/UIKit/UIView/transform",
                  "isActive": true,
                  "type": "reference"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "properties. Don’t directly set these layout-related properties on the view",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "managed by a ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "code": "UIViewControllerRepresentable",
                  "type": "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text": " instance from your own",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "code because that conflicts with SwiftUI and results in undefined behavior.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "name": "Warning",
          "style": "warning",
          "type": "aside"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "content"
    }
